·CU·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"SD","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·SD·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CE","grade":4,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CE·G4·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"GE","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·GE·G5·A"}],"prompt":"Write one sentence: why does your helper need good data as well as a good prompt?"},{"id":"g6-bridging-w5-core-q5","type":"shortText","autoMarked":false,"lookFor":"A reasoned threshold (a proportion or a number of bad entries) tied to the helper's own data and task, with reasoning about when the pattern the helper relies on would be swamped or skewed - e.g. one duplicated entry in a small survey already tips the recommendation. Reasoning matters more than the number.","frameworkRefs":[{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CU","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CU·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"SD","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·SD·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CE","grade":4,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CE·G4·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"GE","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·GE·G5·A"}],"prompt":"Predict how much noise your data can take before the output becomes untrustworthy, and explain your reasoning."}]}},"g6-bridging-w5-lab":{"id":"g6-bridging-w5-lab","number":10,"week":5,"track":"bridging","type":"lab","title":"Trustworthy AI Helper - Build & Refine the Prompt (Part 1 Lab)","summary":"Students turn their Week 5 Core design into a working prototype and improve it by changing one part of the prompt at a time, logging each version, change and effect.","duration":"45 minutes","strands":["CU","SD","CE","GE"],"objectives":["Build a working prototype of the helper using the structured prompt and improved data.","Refine the prompt across versions to raise output quality, logging each change and its effect."],"sections":[{"type":"text","body":["Now build it! Today you turn your design into a working helper and make it better by refining the prompt, one change at a time."]},{"type":"list","heading":"I can…","items":["I can build a working prototype of my helper.","I can refine the prompt across versions and explain what improved."]},{"type":"vocabulary","heading":"Words to know","terms":[{"term":"Prototype","definition":"A first working version you can test and improve."},{"term":"Iterate","definition":"To improve something step by step, testing each change."},{"term":"Version","definition":"One attempt at your prompt that you can compare with the next."}]},{"type":"text","heading":"Build, run, refine","body":["Run your prompt on the improved data and read the output.","Judge it against your task. Then change one part of the prompt and run it again.","Changing one thing at a time tells you what actually helped."]},{"type":"activity","label":"Let's try it - hands-on","body":["Build your prototype and refine the prompt across versions."],"items":["Run prompt v1 on your data.","Judge it against your task.","Change one part; run again.","Log the change and its effect.","Repeat until it meets the task.","Record your best version."]},{"type":"list","heading":"Think about it","items":["Which change improved your output the most?","Why refine one change at a time?","Is your best prompt precise or just long?"]},{"type":"list","heading":"My reflection","items":["My best prompt version is ...","The change that helped most was ... because ...","Next I will check ..."]}],"worksheet":{"title":"Week 5 - Lab - Worksheet | Trustworthy AI Helper - Build & Refine the Prompt (Part 1 Lab)","instructions":"Name: __________________________________  Class: ________________  Date: ________________","questions":[{"id":"g6-bridging-w5-lab-q1","type":"shortText","stem":"v1: ... | effect: ...\nv2: ... | change: ... | effect: ...\nBest version: ...","autoMarked":false,"lookFor":"Distinct versions where exactly ONE part of the prompt changes between them, each with its effect, ending in a named best version. Model: v1 'suggest a book' gave a vague list; v2 added 'one book, with a reason, using the survey' and the output became specific and justified. Watch for pairs changing several things at once, or assuming a longer prompt is a better prompt.","frameworkRefs":[{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CU","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CU·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"SD","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·SD·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CE","grade":4,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CE·G4·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"GE","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·GE·G5·A"}],"prompt":"Log each prompt version, the change you made, and its effect."},{"id":"g6-bridging-w5-lab-q2","type":"shortText","stem":"Columns: Version | Change made | Effect on the output","autoMarked":false,"lookFor":"A complete log from v1 to the best version with a reasoned justification for the key change. This is the formative evidence for SD: iterates the prompt to a measurably better output and explains the causal reason for the improvement. For trial-and-error, prompt 'name the change and its effect'. Record SD as mastery/partial/not-yet.","frameworkRefs":[{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CU","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CU·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"SD","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·SD·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CE","grade":4,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CE·G4·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"GE","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·GE·G5·A"}],"prompt":"Record each version, the change, and the effect on the output."},{"id":"g6-bridging-w5-lab-q3","type":"shortText","autoMarked":false,"lookFor":"Names a specific version, identifies a single change, and gives a causal reason for why that change improved the output (usually added detail, a named data source, or a required form). Reward a one-change improvement with a causal reason; 'it just got better' is partial.","frameworkRefs":[{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CU","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CU·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"SD","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·SD·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CE","grade":4,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CE·G4·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"GE","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·GE·G5·A"}],"prompt":"Name your best prompt version and the one change that improved it most, with a reason."},{"id":"g6-bridging-w5-lab-q4","type":"shortText","autoMarked":false,"lookFor":"Recognises that detail added for accuracy can make the prompt longer and harder to follow, while a short clear prompt may leave the output vague - and names the balance they struck. Precise beats long; look for that judgement being made explicitly.","frameworkRefs":[{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CU","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CU·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"SD","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·SD·G5·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"CE","grade":4,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·CE·G4·A"},{"framework":"AIF","strand":"GE","grade":5,"tier":"A","code":"AIF·GE·G5·A"}],"prompt":"Refine your prompt for accuracy AND clarity at once. Explain the trade-off you had to balance."}]}},"g6-bridging-w6-core":{"id":"g6-bridging-w6-core","number":11,"week":6,"track":"bridging","type":"core","title":"Trustworthy AI Helper - Trace the Data & Plan Checks (Part 2 Core)","summary":"Students trace how the data driving their helper shapes its outcome, then plan a trusted-source verification and a risk check before trusting it.","duration":"45 minutes","strands":["CU","SD","CE","GE"],"objectives":["Explain how the data used influences the helper's outcome, and predict a data change's effect.","Plan how you will verify the output and check for basic risks before trusting it."],"sections":[{"type":"text","body":["Your helper works - now make sure it can be trusted. Today you trace how the data shapes its outcome and plan how you will verify it and check its risks."]},{"type":"list","heading":"I can…","items":["I can explain how the data shapes my helper's outcome and predict a change.","I can plan a verification and a risk check for my helper."]},{"type":"vocabulary","heading":"Words to know","terms":[{"term":"Trace","definition":"To follow h